*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% Cat thermal printer (MXW01, GB01/GB02/GB03/GT01) through the catprinter CUPS backend.
*% The head is 384 dots wide at 203 dpi (48 mm). CUPS renders jobs to 8-bit gray raster
*% and hands them to the backend, which trims blank space, converts and prints them.
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "CATPRNT.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Cat Printer"
*Product: "(Cat Printer)"
*ModelName: "Cat Printer 48mm"
*ShortNickName: "Cat Printer 48mm"
*NickName: "Cat Printer 48mm (catprinter backend)"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.4
*cupsModelNumber: 0
*cupsManualCopies: False
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 0 -"

*OpenUI *PageSize/Paper: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: w136h283
*PageSize w136h142/48 x 50 mm: "<</PageSize[136.3 141.7]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w136h283/48 x 100 mm: "<</PageSize[136.3 283.5]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w136h425/48 x 150 mm: "<</PageSize[136.3 425.2]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w136h842/48 x 297 mm: "<</PageSize[136.3 841.9]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A4/A4 (shrunk to 48 mm): "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter/Letter (shrunk to 48 mm): "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Paper: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: w136h283
*PageRegion w136h142/48 x 50 mm: "<</PageSize[136.3 141.7]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion w136h283/48 x 100 mm: "<</PageSize[136.3 283.5]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion w136h425/48 x 150 mm: "<</PageSize[136.3 425.2]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion w136h842/48 x 297 mm: "<</PageSize[136.3 841.9]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A4/A4 (shrunk to 48 mm): "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Letter/Letter (shrunk to 48 mm): "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: w136h283
*ImageableArea w136h142/48 x 50 mm: "0 0 136.3 141.7"
*ImageableArea w136h283/48 x 100 mm: "0 0 136.3 283.5"
*ImageableArea w136h425/48 x 150 mm: "0 0 136.3 425.2"
*ImageableArea w136h842/48 x 297 mm: "0 0 136.3 841.9"
*ImageableArea A4/A4 (shrunk to 48 mm): "0 0 595 842"
*ImageableArea Letter/Letter (shrunk to 48 mm): "0 0 612 792"

*DefaultPaperDimension: w136h283
*PaperDimension w136h142/48 x 50 mm: "136.3 141.7"
*PaperDimension w136h283/48 x 100 mm: "136.3 283.5"
*PaperDimension w136h425/48 x 150 mm: "136.3 425.2"
*PaperDimension w136h842/48 x 297 mm: "136.3 841.9"
*PaperDimension A4/A4 (shrunk to 48 mm): "595 842"
*PaperDimension Letter/Letter (shrunk to 48 mm): "612 792"

*% Custom lengths on the 48 mm roll.
*VariablePaperSize: True
*MaxMediaWidth: "136.3"
*MaxMediaHeight: "14173"
*HWMargins: 0 0 0 0
*CustomPageSize True: "pop pop pop <</PageSize[5 -2 roll]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*ParamCustomPageSize Width: 1 points 36 136.3
*ParamCustomPageSize Height: 2 points 36 14173
*ParamCustomPageSize WidthOffset: 3 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize HeightOffset: 4 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize Orientation: 5 int 0 0

*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 203dpi
*Resolution 203dpi/203 dpi: "<</HWResolution[203 203]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: Gray
*ColorModel Gray/Grayscale: "<</cupsColorOrder 0/cupsColorSpace 18/cupsBitsPerColor 8>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*% Read by the backend, not by the filters.
*OpenUI *CatTone/Tone: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *CatTone
*DefaultCatTone: Threshold
*CatTone Threshold/Text, labels and barcodes: ""
*CatTone Dither/Photos (dithered black and white): ""
*CatTone Gray/Photos (16 gray levels, MXW01 only): ""
*CloseUI: *CatTone

*OpenUI *CatEnergy/Darkness: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *CatEnergy
*DefaultCatEnergy: 100
*CatEnergy 60/Light: ""
*CatEnergy 80/Medium: ""
*CatEnergy 100/Dark: ""
*CloseUI: *CatEnergy

*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(002.004S)" Standard ROM
